WEBVTT

00:03:29.425 --> 00:03:32.441
da'volash hali ham mushkul masaladir.

00:03:32.441 --> 00:03:36.828
Olimlar NOF-alfa oqsil terapiya usullarini
qollab oldinga ketayaptilar.

00:03:36.828 --> 00:03:40.847
Bu oqsil romatid artrit yallig'lanishing 
asosiy sababchilaridar biridir.

00:03:40.847 --> 00:03:46.017
Ammo, bu usul ham kasallik sababini emas,
kasallik alomatlarini da'volaydi holos.

00:03:46.017 --> 00:03:51.509
Bu orada esa, artrit oldini olishning eng 
yanhshi himoyasi bu hayot tarzidir, misol

00:03:51.509 --> 00:03:54.538
sog'lom vazn ushlash, bu bo'g'imlarga 
bosimni tushiradi, yoki

00:03:54.538 --> 00:03:59.258
yoga va velosiped minish kabi oson 
mashq'ulotlar bajarish, va chekmaslik.

00:03:59.258 --> 00:04:03.192
Bu kabi artrit oldini oladigan faoliyatlar
uzoq umr kechirishimizga yordam beradi.